
"smart_sources:30-Resouces/01-Software/15.Office/Outlook使用技巧.md": {"path":"30-Resouces/01-Software/15.Office/Outlook使用技巧.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"150bzww","at":1781360118552},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1781335743959,"size":27715,"at":1781360118586,"hash":"150bzww"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,5],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>":[7,208],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{1}":[8,15],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{2}":[16,16],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{3}":[17,17],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{4}":[18,18],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{5}":[19,19],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{6}":[20,20],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{7}":[21,21],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{8}":[22,23],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{9}":[24,24],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{10}":[25,29],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{11}":[30,30],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{12}":[31,32],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{13}":[33,33],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{14}":[34,34],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{15}":[35,100],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{16}":[101,101],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{17}":[102,102],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{18}":[103,103],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{19}":[104,104],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{20}":[105,105],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{21}":[106,106],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{22}":[107,107],"##<span style='color:#2E75B5'>Outlook使用技巧 </span>#{23}":[108,208]},"outlinks":[{"title":" ℃ 一 Sorry 《 meant the Old server &quot;container&quot;. 8 凵 t its Brlan Day RE: Error on 2010 application logs regarding 2 [ ℃ 一 If yo 凵 have a n Old 〔 0 y Of ExBPA it may not 5 x 当 前 玉 霏 g / 5 / 2017 g / 5 / 2017 g / 5 / 2017 \" />\n再说**大小**，Outlook很早就有一套预设的大小标准，见下表：  \n\n- **Empty**: 0KB\n- **Tiny**: 0 – 10KB\n- **Small**: 10 – 100KB\n- **Medium**: 100KB – 1MB\n- **Large**: 1 – 16MB\n- **Huge**: 16 – 128MB\n- **Gigantic**: \\>128MB\n因为一般来说我们不会很清楚地知道一封邮件的确切大小，但会知道是大邮件还是小邮件，比如说项目组的周报一般是中等大小，设计部的方案图纸都是Huge大小等等。当然这个参数不怎么常用，这里就不做展开了，它同样支持AND和OR的逻辑符运算（**默认逻辑AND**）。  \n\n<img src=\"C:\\Users\\lindo\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\东乐 的笔记本\\pandoc/media/image23.png\" style=\"width:4.83333in;height:2.69792in\" alt=\"引 z 已 m 巳 引 凵 m AN D s 已 &gt; 502K8 全 部 耒 读 Brian Rei&amp; RE: 0 ℃ M Issues With the Admin PO a 0 卜 dear _ its a case Of Microsoft changing things Johnnie Li GTS Log 卮 〔 ion Hi Kevin, 才 在 能 到 GTS 的 志 ， 适 x 当 前 玉 霏 之 55 AM x Tue g / 12 \" />\n<span style='background:white'></span><span style='font-weight:bold;background:white'>内容</span><span style='background: white'>关键字可能是搜索中最常用的表述方式了，按照内容所处位置，可细分为收发件人关键字（</span><span style='font-weight: bold;background:white'>from:</span><span style='background:white'>，</span><span style='font-weight:bold;background:white'>to:</span><span style='background: white'>，</span><span style='font-weight:bold;background:white'>cc:</span><span style='background:white'>，</span><span style='font-weight:bold;background:white'>bcc:</span><span style='background:white'>）主题关键字(</span><span style='font-weight:bold; background:white'>subject:</span><span style='background:white'>)，正文关键字（</span><span style='font-weight:bold;background:white'>contents:</span><span style='background:white'>）和附件中的关键字（</span><span style='font-weight:bold; background:white'>attachment:</span><span style='background:white'>）</span>\n<img src=\"C:\\Users\\lindo\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\东乐 的笔记本\\pandoc/media/image24.png\" style=\"width:5.4375in;height:2.10417in\" alt=\"fromsam 」 e 〔 t ． 凸 志 〔 on nts 渊 先 级 attachment:exchange 全 部 耒 读 上 个 月 Sam x 当 前 玉 霏 X 8 / 25 / 2017 8 / 22 / 2017 \" />\n如果直接输入某个关键字，以上四处都会进行搜索并返回结果。这里大家可能想不到的是附件中的关键字也能被搜到。是的，附件是默认的搜索位置，**如果不想等待结果时间太长，请把附件移出邮件收到本地吧**。哦对了，如果不想词组被拆开搜索，**记得用引号\"\"括起来**哦。  \n\n<img src=\"C:\\Users\\lindo\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\东乐 的笔记本\\pandoc/media/image25.png\" style=\"width:5.4375in;height:2.57292in\" alt=\"&quot;Disciplined, syst 巳 m i 匚 ra 引 巳 m salving s 划 required 上 个 月 Emailing. 」 D - Desktop Administrator update 20170724 冠 oc You r message is ready to 5 巳 sent with the following file or link attachments: 」 D - D 巳 s 0 舁 Administrator - update 20170724 冠 o 〔 x 当 前 玉 霏 8 / 23 / 2017 已 完 成 。 如 果 你 吉 不 到 要 查 找 的 内 容 ， 请 尝 试 更 昼 的 内 容 。 \" />\n<span style='background:white'>除了上述这些呢，邮件还有一些</span><span style='font-weight:bold;background:white'>自身的属性</span><span style='background: white'>可以被搜索，详见下表：</span>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 48%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 25%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 25%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>属性</span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>标识</span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>示例</span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>是否带附件</span></td>\n<td>hasattachment,<br />\nhasattachments</td>\n<td>hasattachment:true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>分类</span></td>\n<td>category</td>\n<td>category:red</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>标记</span></td>\n<td>hasflag, isflagged</td>\n<td>hasflag:false</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold;font-family:inherit;color:white;background:#0082CE'>标记状态</span><br />\n</td>\n<td>flagstatus<br />\nflagstatus:followup</td>\n<td>flagstatus:unflagged<br />\nflagstatus:completed<br />\nflagstatus:followupflag</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>标记截止时间</span></td>\n<td>duedate, due</td>\n<td>due:10/15/2016</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>重要性</span></td>\n<td>importance</td>\n<td>importance:low<br />\nimportnace:normal<br />\nimportance:high</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>搜索文件夹</span></td>\n<td>folderpath</td>\n<td>folderpath:Inbox</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>完成状态</span></td>\n<td>iscompleted</td>\n<td>iscompleted:true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style='font-weight:bold; background:#0082CE'>已读状态</span></td>\n<td>read, isread</td>\n<td>isread:false</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span style='background:white'>当然对于以上指令还不是特别熟悉的用户，除了快捷搜索框，咱还可以通过Outlook的高级搜索功能（快捷键</span><span style='font-weight:bold;background:white'>Ctrl+Shift+F</span><span style='background:white'>）设置各种复杂的组合搜索条件，这里就不一一展开了。</span>\n![image26","target":"ba862eb916e4cc3d.png","line":98},{"title":"image27","target":"9f77209e781740728e18d2cc0c8862a5.png","line":189,"embedded":true},{"title":"image28","target":"2101b4b0b7474cfb98148a880bae39a0.jpg","line":192,"embedded":true},{"title":"image29","target":"1bb5484528c940cfbc119856c78e2257.png","line":193,"embedded":true},{"title":"赞赏","target":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA3NTkxMTE1OA==&mid=2649564581&idx=1&sn=f094feda61cc0424fd20d47ae2d85284&chksm=8770df3cb007562a03edf739c2e823048d8fa6b5965d64b663877f6468ae4415e8222ee856df&mpshare=1&scene=1&srcid=0312lU67OExvviLjJ7hmv0V7##","line":196},{"title":"image30","target":"92eeeb92245a45f5b441bf958fb20f46.png","line":198,"embedded":true},{"title":"投诉","target":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA3NTkxMTE1OA==&mid=2649564581&idx=1&sn=f094feda61cc0424fd20d47ae2d85284&chksm=8770df3cb007562a03edf739c2e823048d8fa6b5965d64b663877f6468ae4415e8222ee856df&mpshare=1&scene=1&srcid=0312lU67OExvviLjJ7hmv0V7##","line":201},{"title":"取消","target":"javascript:void(0","line":206},{"title":"打开","target":"javascript:void(0","line":206}],"metadata":{"title":"Outlook使用技巧","updated":"2026-06-06T10:08","created":"2018-03-12T10:12:25"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:30-Resouces/01-Software/15.Office/Outlook使用技巧.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1sr9t8j","at":1781360118552},"key":"30-Resouces/01-Software/15.Office/Outlook使用技巧.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,5],"size":81,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
